        <detaileddescription>
<para>Save.</para>
<para>Reads <computeroutput>source_path</computeroutput>, copies it to <computeroutput>checkpoint_dir/&lt;filename&gt;.tmp</computeroutput>, computes its SHA-256, renames to the final path, then updates the manifest. The oldest entry is pruned once the rolling window overflows.</para>
